<p class="blog-meta blog-meta-cat">Criminal Justice Committee</p>
<h2 class="blog-title"><a href="/news/september-2026/criminal-justice-committee-meeting-summary-(1)/">Criminal Justice Committee Meeting Summary</a></h2>
<!-- If There is no video -->
<div class="blog-teaser-image">
<img alt="Seal of the City of New Orleans" src="/council/media/Assets/site/CitySeal_Blue.png" width="95"/>
</div>
<!-- If there is a video -->
<div class="blog-content">
<p><strong>NEW ORLEANS, LA</strong> - On Monday, September 28, 2026, the Criminal Justice Committee met to hear from Juvenile Justice Intervention Center (JJIC) youth and Executive Director Dichelle Williams. The committee also reviewed Amendment No. 2 to a Professional Services Agreement between Ubuntu Village NOLA and the City.</p>
</div>
</div><div class="blog-teaser">
<p class="blog-meta">September 23, 2026</p>
<p class="blog-meta blog-meta-cat">Climate and Sustainability Committee</p>
<h2 class="blog-title"><a href="/news/september-2026/climate-change-and-sustainability-committee-meetin/">Climate Change and Sustainability Committee Meeting Summary</a></h2>
<!-- If There is no video -->
<div class="blog-teaser-image">
<img alt="Seal of the City of New Orleans" src="/council/media/Assets/site/CitySeal_Blue.png" width="95"/>
</div>
<!-- If there is a video -->
<div class="blog-content">
<p><strong>NEW ORLEANS, LA</strong> - On Wednesday, September 23, 2026, the Climate Change and Sustainability Committee held a meeting to consider a resolution establishing parameters for Phase III of the Energy Smart Battery Energy Storage System Distributed Energy Resource Program and a motion related to professional services for the West End Drainage Modular Tank System project. The committee also received a presentation from the Lafitte Greenway Partnership on planned improvements to the Lafitte Greenway and the status of the final half-mile tract.</p>
</div>
